              "e": "help me"
            },
            {
              "c": "嗎",
              "j": "maa3",
              "e": "(question particle)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sid": "modals-t1-s03",
          "c": "我唔識游水。",
          "j": "ngo5 m4 sik1 jau4 seoi2.",
          "e": "I don't know how to swim.",
          "note": "識 (sik1) here is \"know how to (do a skill)\" — 唔識游水 (m4 sik1 jau4 seoi2) \"can't swim / don't know how to\". 游水 (jau4 seoi2) is the Cantonese \"to swim\" (literally \"swim-water\").",
